# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# job-finder — OPTIONAL discovery keys (BYO). Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# IMPORTANT: There is NO scoring API key here, by design. Scoring runs through
# whatever AI CLI you already have, not through a key this app holds.
#
# The default discovery channel (public ATS scan) needs NONE of these keys —
# it is free and runs out of the box. The keys below only enable extra,
# opt-in discovery channels. Each is YOUR own account; you bear its cost/ToS.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Co-primary India-native — Adzuna official API (country=in), free tier. Register
# a free app at https://developer.adzuna.com to get both values. Sent only to
# api.adzuna.com as query params — never logged, never persisted.
# ADZUNA_APP_ID=
# ADZUNA_APP_KEY=

# Supplement (gap-fill) — JSearch (OpenWeb Ninja): Google-for-Jobs incl. LinkedIn/
# Naukri/Indeed. Free tier ~200 req/month. Two hosts (set which in config/sources.yml
# → jsearch.host):
#   • rapidapi     → subscribe to "JSearch" (free Basic) at rapidapi.com, copy the key
#   • openwebninja → sign up at https://openwebninja.com, copy the key
# Spent only when Adzuna is thin. Sent only as the host's auth header — never logged.
# JSEARCH_API_KEY=

# Layer 2 — Google Jobs (indirect LinkedIn/board coverage via Google's index).
# Get one free key at https://serpapi.com (or Serper.dev). Optional; overlaps JSearch.
# SERPAPI_KEY=
# SERPER_API_KEY=

# Deep mode (opt-in, OFF by default) — Apify BYO-token: FULL-JD Naukri + LinkedIn +
# Indeed scrape. Cookieless actors hit each platform's PUBLIC guest API — no login,
# no account-ban risk. Free $5/mo credit, no card: https://apify.com. Off unless this
# token is set AND config/sources.yml → apify.enabled: true. Runs bill to YOUR Apify
# account; you accept each board's ToS directly. Sent only as Authorization: Bearer
# to api.apify.com — never logged, never persisted.
# APIFY_TOKEN=
